# Destination allowlist for tinyproxy (FilterExtended Yes, so these are
# POSIX extended regexes). One anchored pattern per admitted provider host
# in router/providers.json — anchors on both ends so e.g. `evil-groq.com`
# or `api.groq.com.evil.tld` cannot match. Nothing else belongs here.
^api\.groq\.com$
^generativelanguage\.googleapis\.com$
^openrouter\.ai$
